modules=[
 {'en':'Electrical fundamentals','id':'Dasar kelistrikan','level':('Beginner','Dasar'),'prereq':('No prior experience required.','Belum perlu pengalaman sebelumnya.'),'objective':('Distinguish voltage, current, resistance and power; read simple series and parallel paths.','Membedakan tegangan, arus, resistansi, dan daya; membaca jalur seri dan paralel sederhana.'),'lessons':[
 ('Voltage','Tegangan','Voltage is potential difference between two points. Measure across a component, not from one terminal alone.','Tegangan adalah beda potensial di antara dua titik. Ukur di kedua terminal komponen, bukan pada satu terminal saja.','Use a meter in parallel across the load.','Gunakan meter secara paralel pada beban.'),
 ('Current','Arus','Current flows only when a complete path exists. An open switch interrupts that path.','Arus mengalir hanya jika jalurnya lengkap. Saklar terbuka memutus jalur tersebut.','Identify the source, load and return before tracing current.','Kenali sumber, beban, dan jalur balik sebelum menelusuri arus.'),
 ('Resistance and Ohm’s Law','Resistansi dan Hukum Ohm','For a linear resistor, V = I × R. At fixed voltage, higher resistance means lower current.','Untuk resistor linear, V = I × R. Pada tegangan tetap, resistansi lebih tinggi berarti arus lebih rendah.','Calculate current through 96 Ω at 24 V.','Hitung arus pada resistansi 96 Ω dengan sumber 24 V.'),
 ('Power','Daya','For DC, P = V × I. Real AC active power also depends on power factor.','Untuk DC, P = V × I. Daya aktif AC nyata juga dipengaruhi faktor daya.','Estimate DC load power, then state what the ideal model omits.','Perkirakan daya beban DC, lalu sebutkan hal yang tidak dihitung model ideal.'),
 ('Series and parallel paths','Jalur seri dan paralel','Series loads share current; parallel branches share voltage. Branch currents add at the source.','Beban seri memiliki arus yang sama; cabang paralel memiliki tegangan yang sama. Arus cabang dijumlahkan di sumber.','Compare two resistors in series and in parallel.','Bandingkan dua resistor yang dirangkai seri dan paralel.') ]},
 {'en':'DC circuits','id':'Rangkaian DC','level':('Beginner','Dasar'),'prereq':('Electrical fundamentals.','Dasar kelistrikan.'),'objective':('Wire DC sources and loads with correct polarity and a complete return path.','Merangkai sumber dan beban DC dengan polaritas benar serta jalur balik yang lengkap.'),'lessons':[
 ('Battery and supply','Battery dan power supply','A DC source has positive and negative terminals. VoltLab models an ideal source and does not include internal resistance.','Sumber DC memiliki terminal positif dan negatif. VoltLab memakai sumber ideal tanpa resistansi internal.','Label positive, load and return on a simple circuit.','Tandai positif, beban, dan jalur balik pada rangkaian sederhana.'),
 ('Switch and continuity','Switch dan kontinuitas','A closed contact conducts; an open contact breaks continuity. ON alone does not prove the load has a return.','Kontak tertutup menghantarkan arus; kontak terbuka memutus kontinuitas. Posisi ON belum membuktikan jalur balik beban lengkap.','Open one connection and locate the first lost path.','Putuskan satu koneksi dan cari titik pertama jalur terputus.'),
 ('LED and resistor','LED dan resistor','An LED needs current limiting. A first estimate is R = (Vs − Vf) / I. Verify power and standard values for real work.','LED memerlukan pembatas arus. Estimasi awal R = (Vs − Vf) / I. Verifikasi daya dan nilai standar untuk pekerjaan nyata.','Estimate a series resistor for a 12 V source, 2 V LED, 20 mA target.','Perkirakan resistor seri untuk sumber 12 V, LED 2 V, target 20 mA.'),
 ('Relay and polarity','Relay dan polaritas','A relay coil controls separate contacts. Check A1–A2 rating and AC/DC type; preserve polarity for sensitive DC loads.','Coil relay mengendalikan kontak terpisah. Periksa rating A1–A2 dan tipe AC/DC; jaga polaritas beban DC yang sensitif.','Operate a relay coil and observe NO and NC contact state.','Aktifkan coil relay lalu amati kondisi kontak NO dan NC.') ]},
 {'en':'AC fundamentals','id':'Dasar AC','level':('Beginner','Dasar'),'prereq':('Electrical fundamentals.','Dasar kelistrikan.'),'objective':('Identify L, N and PE; understand RMS voltage, frequency and phase relationships.','Mengenali L, N, dan PE; memahami tegangan RMS, frekuensi, dan hubungan fasa.'),'lessons':[
 ('Live, neutral and protective earth','Live, neutral, dan protective earth','L is the active conductor. N provides the normal return in a single-phase circuit. PE is a protective conductor, not a normal load return.','L adalah penghantar aktif. N menjadi jalur balik normal satu fasa. PE adalah penghantar proteksi, bukan jalur balik beban normal.','Trace L and N through a 230 V load. Keep PE function separate.','Telusuri L dan N melalui beban 230 V. Pisahkan fungsi PE.'),
 ('RMS and frequency','RMS dan frekuensi','AC values are commonly expressed as RMS. Frequency in hertz counts cycles per second. VoltLab uses an ideal phasor model.','Nilai AC umumnya dinyatakan sebagai RMS. Frekuensi dalam hertz menghitung siklus per detik. VoltLab menggunakan model fasor ideal.','Explain what a 50 Hz rating means.','Jelaskan arti rating 50 Hz.'),
 ('Three phase','Three phase','L1, L2 and L3 are separated by 120°. For a balanced system, VLL = √3 × VLN. Phase sequence affects motor direction.','L1, L2, dan L3 berbeda sudut 120°. Pada sistem seimbang, VLL = √3 × VLN. Urutan fasa memengaruhi arah motor.','Relate 400 V line-to-line to approximately 231 V phase-to-neutral.','Hubungkan 400 V antarfasa dengan sekitar 231 V fasa-ke-netral.') ]},
 {'en':'Protection devices','id':'Perangkat proteksi','level':('Intermediate','Menengah'),'prereq':('AC/DC fundamentals and terminal identification.','Dasar AC/DC dan identifikasi terminal.'),'objective':('Differentiate switching, overcurrent, short-circuit and motor overload functions.','Membedakan fungsi switching, arus lebih, hubung singkat, dan overload motor.'),'lessons':[
 ('Fuse, MCB and MCCB','Fuse, MCB, dan MCCB','Each device has ratings, breaking capacity and application limits. The simulator does not calculate physical time-current curves or selectivity.','Setiap perangkat memiliki rating, kapasitas pemutusan, dan batas aplikasi. Simulator tidak menghitung kurva waktu-arus fisik atau selektivitas.','Compare device nameplate data with the circuit design, not appearance alone.','Bandingkan data nameplate dengan desain rangkaian, bukan bentuk saja.'),
 ('Overload relay','Overload relay','The training model opens NC 95–96 during a manual trip. An overload relay does not replace short-circuit protection.','Model latihan membuka kontak NC 95–96 saat trip manual. Overload relay tidak menggantikan proteksi hubung singkat.','Trace 95–96 in series with the contactor coil.','Telusuri 95–96 yang dipasang seri dengan coil contactor.'),
 ('Protective earth','Protective earth','PE connects exposed conductive parts into the protective earthing system. It is not a normal current return.','PE menghubungkan bagian konduktif yang dapat tersentuh ke sistem pembumian proteksi. PE bukan jalur arus normal.','Explain why PE and neutral must not be treated as interchangeable.','Jelaskan mengapa PE dan neutral tidak boleh dianggap sama.') ]},
 {'en':'Motor control','id':'Kontrol motor','level':('Intermediate','Menengah'),'prereq':('DC circuits and protection-device functions.','Rangkaian DC dan fungsi perangkat proteksi.'),'objective':('Build a contactor control path with START/STOP, self holding and overload interruption.','Membangun jalur kontrol contactor dengan START/STOP, self holding, dan pemutus overload.'),'lessons':[
 ('Contactor and relay','Contactor dan relay','A1–A2 is the coil. Main contacts switch the load; auxiliary 13–14 NO and 21–22 NC support control logic.','A1–A2 adalah coil. Kontak utama mengalihkan beban; auxiliary 13–14 NO dan 21–22 NC dipakai dalam logika kontrol.','Separate the coil path from the three-phase power path.','Pisahkan jalur coil dari jalur daya tiga fasa.'),
 ('START / STOP and self holding','START / STOP dan self holding','STOP NC is in series. START NO momentarily energizes the coil. Auxiliary NO 13–14 is wired in parallel with START to hold the coil.','STOP NC dipasang seri. START NO mengaktifkan coil sesaat. Auxiliary NO 13–14 dipasang paralel dengan START untuk menahan coil.','Press START, release it, then press STOP. Observe contactor state.','Tekan START, lepaskan, lalu tekan STOP. Amati kondisi contactor.'),
 ('DOL starter','DOL starter','A DOL path uses upstream protection, contactor main poles and overload before the motor. Control interruption must drop the coil.','Jalur DOL memakai proteksi hulu, pole utama contactor, dan overload sebelum motor. Pemutusan kontrol harus melepas coil.','Trace each phase and the control loop separately.','Telusuri setiap fasa dan loop kontrol secara terpisah.') ]},
 {'en':'Industrial panel design','id':'Desain panel industri','level':('Advanced','Lanjutan'),'prereq':('Motor control and panel component identification.','Kontrol motor dan identifikasi komponen panel.'),'objective':('Arrange devices and wiring for legibility, maintenance access and traceability.','Menyusun perangkat dan wiring agar terbaca, mudah dirawat, dan mudah ditelusuri.'),'lessons':[
 ('DIN rail and mounting','DIN rail dan pemasangan','Mount only compatible modular devices. Confirm rail type, latch engagement, spacing and service access.','Pasang hanya perangkat modular yang kompatibel. Pastikan tipe rail, pengunci, jarak, dan akses servis sesuai.'),
 ('Wire duct and segregation','Wire duct dan pemisahan jalur','Route conductors by function. Follow enclosure fill, bend radius, separation and thermal requirements from approved design and manufacturer data.','Rutekan penghantar berdasarkan fungsi. Ikuti isi duct, radius tekuk, pemisahan, dan kebutuhan temperatur dari desain dan data pabrikan.'),
 ('Power and control routing','Routing daya dan kontrol','Keep the power path and control path distinguishable in the drawing. Label every wire and terminal to match the schematic.','Bedakan jalur daya dan kontrol pada gambar. Beri label setiap kabel dan terminal agar cocok dengan skematik.'),
 ('Terminal blocks and BOM','Terminal block dan BOM','Terminal blocks join field cables to panel wiring. A BOM lists tag, description, rating, quantity and source reference.','Terminal block menyambungkan kabel lapangan ke wiring panel. BOM mencatat tag, deskripsi, rating, jumlah, dan referensi.'),
 ('Cable sizing overview','Gambaran ukuran kabel','Cable sizing depends on load, installation method, temperature, length, voltage drop, protection and local standards. Obtain engineering approval.','Ukuran kabel bergantung beban, metode pemasangan, temperatur, panjang, jatuh tegangan, proteksi, dan standar lokal. Minta persetujuan engineering.') ]},
 {'en':'Troubleshooting','id':'Troubleshooting','level':('Advanced','Lanjutan'),'prereq':('AC fundamentals, protection and motor control.','Dasar AC, proteksi, dan kontrol motor.'),'objective':('Use symptoms, drawings and measurements to isolate a fault without guessing.','Menggunakan gejala, gambar, dan pengukuran untuk mengisolasi gangguan secara sistematis.'),'lessons':[
 ('Open circuit','Rangkaian terbuka','Trace source, protective device, control contacts, load and return. Find the first point where the expected path is absent.','Telusuri sumber, proteksi, kontak kontrol, beban, dan jalur balik. Temukan titik pertama jalur yang seharusnya ada namun terputus.'),
 ('Wrong NO / NC','Kesalahan NO / NC','NO is open and NC is closed in the normal, unoperated state. Check terminal numbers and the device diagram.','NO terbuka dan NC tertutup pada kondisi normal. Periksa nomor terminal dan diagram perangkat.'),
 ('Coil and overload faults','Gangguan coil dan overload','Measure A1–A2 under the command. Check rating, supply type, return path and 95–96 continuity. Follow approved safe-work procedures.','Ukur A1–A2 saat perintah diberikan. Periksa rating, tipe sumber, jalur balik, dan kontinuitas 95–96. Ikuti prosedur kerja aman.'),
 ('Phase loss','Kehilangan fasa','Trace L1/L2/L3 through each pole and overload to U/V/W. This ideal model does not calculate motor heating.','Telusuri L1/L2/L3 melalui setiap pole dan overload hingga U/V/W. Model ideal ini tidak menghitung pemanasan motor.') ]},
 {'en':'Industrial automation','id':'Otomasi industri','level':('Expert','Ahli'),'prereq':('Motor control, troubleshooting and instrumentation basics.','Kontrol motor, troubleshooting, dan dasar instrumentasi.'),'objective':('Understand the signal chain between sensors, PLC inputs, program logic and outputs.','Memahami rantai sinyal antara sensor, input PLC, logika program, dan output.'),'lessons':[
 ('PLC scan and digital input','Siklus PLC dan digital input','A PLC reads inputs, executes logic and updates outputs. Check supply, common, input voltage and sinking/sourcing type.','PLC membaca input, menjalankan logika, lalu memperbarui output. Periksa suplai, common, tegangan input, dan tipe sinking/sourcing.'),
 ('Inductive and photoelectric sensors','Sensor inductive dan photoelectric','Check sensing method, range, target, PNP/NPN output, supply and pinout against the manufacturer sheet.','Periksa metode sensing, jarak, target, output PNP/NPN, suplai, dan pinout pada datasheet pabrikan.'),
 ('Timer, interlocks and VFD','Timer, interlock, dan VFD','A timer changes contacts over time. A VFD controls motor speed by varying output frequency. Use approved parameter and interlock documentation.','Timer mengubah kontak berdasarkan waktu. VFD mengendalikan kecepatan motor dengan mengubah frekuensi keluaran. Gunakan dokumentasi parameter dan interlock yang disetujui.'),
 ('Commissioning records','Catatan commissioning','Verify drawings, device ratings, terminals and test results against the approved procedure. Record deviations and stop if a safety condition is uncertain.','Verifikasi gambar, rating perangkat, terminal, dan hasil uji terhadap prosedur yang disetujui. Catat deviasi dan hentikan jika kondisi keselamatan belum jelas.') ]}
]

for lang in ('id','en'):
 is_id=lang=='id'; title='Panduan Belajar Kelistrikan Industri' if is_id else 'Industrial Electrical Learning Guide'
 filename=OUT/('panduan-kelistrikan-industri-id.pdf' if is_id else 'industrial-electrical-learning-guide-en.pdf')
 styles=getSampleStyleSheet()
 styles.add(ParagraphStyle(name='CoverTitleV',fontName='VoltSans-Bold',fontSize=25,leading=32,textColor=INK,spaceAfter=10))
 styles.add(ParagraphStyle(name='CoverDeckV',fontName='VoltSans',fontSize=12,leading=19,textColor=MUTED,spaceAfter=17))
 styles.add(ParagraphStyle(name='ModuleTitleV',fontName='VoltSans-Bold',fontSize=18,leading=24,textColor=INK,spaceBefore=5,spaceAfter=7))
 styles.add(ParagraphStyle(name='SectionTitleV',fontName='VoltSans-Bold',fontSize=13,leading=18,textColor=INK,spaceBefore=8,spaceAfter=5))
 styles.add(ParagraphStyle(name='LessonTitleV',fontName='VoltSans-Bold',fontSize=12,leading=17,textColor=BLUE,spaceBefore=10,spaceAfter=4))
 styles.add(ParagraphStyle(name='BodyV',fontName='VoltSans',fontSize=9.3,leading=15,textColor=INK,spaceAfter=5))
 styles.add(ParagraphStyle(name='SmallV',fontName='VoltSans',fontSize=8,leading=12,textColor=MUTED,spaceAfter=5))
 styles.add(ParagraphStyle(name='CalloutV',fontName='VoltSans-Bold',fontSize=9.2,leading=14,textColor=INK,backColor=SOFT,borderPadding=8,spaceBefore=4,spaceAfter=7))
 styles.add(ParagraphStyle(name='CreditV',fontName='VoltSans',fontSize=8,leading=12,textColor=MUTED,alignment=TA_CENTER))
 story=[Spacer(1,22*mm),Paragraph('VOLTLAB / FEBRO HERDYANTO',styles['SmallV']),Spacer(1,6*mm),Paragraph(title,styles['CoverTitleV']),Paragraph(('Dari dasar listrik sampai kontrol dan otomasi industri.' if is_id else 'From electrical fundamentals to industrial control and automation.'),styles['CoverDeckV']),HRFlowable(width='100%',thickness=2,color=BLUE,spaceBefore=4,spaceAfter=14),Paragraph(('Urutan belajar' if is_id else 'Learning sequence'),styles['SectionTitleV'])]
 story.append(Paragraph(('Mulai dari konsep dasar, praktikkan rangkaian DC dan AC, pelajari proteksi serta kontrol motor, lalu lanjutkan ke desain panel, troubleshooting, dan otomasi.' if is_id else 'Start with fundamentals, practice DC and AC circuits, study protection and motor control, then continue to panel design, troubleshooting and automation.'),styles['BodyV']))
 story.append(Paragraph(('Batas keselamatan: materi ini untuk pembelajaran. VoltLab memakai model ideal dan bukan alat untuk menyetujui desain, menentukan proteksi, atau menggantikan prosedur kerja. Gunakan datasheet, standar yang berlaku, personel kompeten, dan prosedur isolasi energi sebelum pekerjaan nyata.' if is_id else 'Safety boundary: this guide is for learning. VoltLab uses ideal models and does not approve designs, select protection or replace work procedures. Use manufacturer data, applicable standards, qualified personnel and energy-isolation procedures before real work.'),styles['CalloutV']))
 story.append(Spacer(1,5*mm))
 for idx,m in enumerate(modules,1):
  name=m['id'] if is_id else m['en']; level=m['level'][1 if is_id else 0];pr=m['prereq'][1 if is_id else 0];obj=m['objective'][1 if is_id else 0]
  story.append(PageBreak());story.append(Paragraph(f'{idx:02d} / {level.upper()}',styles['SmallV']));story.append(Paragraph(name,styles['ModuleTitleV']))
  story.append(Paragraph(('<b>Prasyarat:</b> ' if is_id else '<b>Prerequisite:</b> ')+pr,styles['BodyV']))
  story.append(Paragraph(('<b>Tujuan modul:</b> ' if is_id else '<b>Module outcome:</b> ')+obj,styles['BodyV']))
  story.append(Paragraph(('Pelajaran' if is_id else 'Lessons'),styles['SectionTitleV']))
  for item in m['lessons']:
   en,ind,body_en,body_id=item[:4]
   task_en,task_id=item[4:] if len(item)==6 else (f'Explain the key point for {en} and test it on a labelled practice circuit.',f'Jelaskan inti {ind} dan uji pada rangkaian latihan yang diberi label.')
   lesson=ind if is_id else en;body=body_id if is_id else body_en;task=task_id if is_id else task_en
   story.append(KeepTogether([Paragraph(lesson,styles['LessonTitleV']),Paragraph(body,styles['BodyV']),Paragraph(('<b>Latihan:</b> ' if is_id else '<b>Practice:</b> ')+task,styles['SmallV'])]))
  story.append(Spacer(1,3*mm));story.append(Paragraph(('Pemeriksaan diri: dapatkah Anda menjelaskan jalur terminal, rating yang relevan, kondisi normal, dan batas model simulasi sebelum menyatakan rangkaian siap?' if is_id else 'Self-check: can you explain the terminal path, relevant ratings, normal state and simulation limits before calling the circuit ready?'),styles['CalloutV']))
 story.append(PageBreak());story.append(Paragraph(('Referensi kerja' if is_id else 'Working reference'),styles['ModuleTitleV']))
 story.append(Paragraph(('Untuk gambar rangkaian, gunakan penandaan terminal sesuai datasheet. Pemeriksaan sebelum energisasi harus mengikuti prosedur dan standar instalasi yang berlaku. Materi VoltLab tidak menetapkan ukuran kabel atau rating pemutus untuk proyek nyata.' if is_id else 'Use terminal designations from the device data sheet in circuit drawings. Pre-energization checks must follow applicable installation standards and procedures. VoltLab material does not select conductor sizes or breaker ratings for real projects.'),styles['BodyV']))
 story.append(Spacer(1,8*mm));story.append(Paragraph(('Kredit materi' if is_id else 'Credits'),styles['SectionTitleV']))
 story.append(Paragraph('VoltLab by Febro Herdyanto',styles['BodyV']))
 story.append(Paragraph(('Materi pembelajaran independen. Ilustrasi dan simulasi disederhanakan untuk menjelaskan konsep dasar.' if is_id else 'Independent educational material. Illustrations and simulations are simplified to explain foundational concepts.'),styles['BodyV']))
 def footer(canvas,doc):
  canvas.saveState();w,h=A4;canvas.setStrokeColor(colors.HexColor('#d7e0e6'));canvas.setLineWidth(.5);canvas.line(18*mm,15*mm,w-18*mm,15*mm);canvas.setFont('VoltSans',7.5);canvas.setFillColor(MUTED);credit='VoltLab by Febro Herdyanto  •  '+('Materi edukasi' if is_id else 'Educational guide');canvas.drawString(18*mm,10*mm,credit);canvas.drawRightString(w-18*mm,10*mm,str(doc.page));canvas.restoreState()
 doc=SimpleDocTemplate(str(filename),pagesize=A4,rightMargin=19*mm,leftMargin=19*mm,topMargin=18*mm,bottomMargin=23*mm,title=title,author='Febro Herdyanto · VoltLab',subject='Industrial electrical learning modules')
 doc.build(story,onFirstPage=footer,onLaterPages=footer)
 print(filename.name,filename.stat().st_size)
